title Cassette notice on the trim page (T6d): Saved 3 new files replaces the top strip; the layout check passes while it shows
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NOTICE "Saved 3 new files"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 300
key t
wait 400
expect text "Saved 3 new files"
shot trim-saved
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect text "SAVE"
expect noquit
